# 🚗 RegoCheck – Vehicle Registration Number Validator

RegoCheck is a modern web application built using **HTML, CSS, and JavaScript** that validates Indian vehicle registration numbers based on the standard registration format. The application checks every segment of the registration number individually and provides detailed feedback whenever an invalid format is detected.

The project uses **custom JavaScript error classes**, **try-catch exception handling**, and **real-time validation** to create an interactive and user-friendly validation experience.

---

## 📌 Features

* Validate Indian vehicle registration numbers
* Modern and responsive user interface
* Real-time registration plate preview
* Live validation checklist
* Individual validation for each plate segment
* Detailed error messages using custom exceptions
* Try-Catch based exception handling
* Hero preview with dynamic status indicators
* Clear and reset functionality
* Interactive result banners
* Keyboard support (Press Enter to validate)

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

* HTML5
* CSS3
* JavaScript (ES6)

---

